# Changelog - Urban Style Clothing Website

All notable changes and updates for this repository are logged below:

## [1.2.0] - 2026-08-12
### Added
- Embedded location map on `contact.html` pointing to Polokwane store[span_24](start_span)[span_24](end_span).
- Sourced high-resolution streetwear photography from Unsplash.

## [1.1.0] - 2026-08-10
### Added
- Constructed item reservation form with size and category selection on `enquiry.html`[span_25](start_span)[span_25](end_span).
- Formatted product pricing and streetwear categories on `products.html`[span_26](start_span)[span_26](end_span).

## [1.0.0] - 2026-08-05
### Added
- Initialized repository with multi-page HTML semantic skeleton and interlinked header menu.
